Description:
    Provides methods for efficient subdata selection for large-scale and high-dimensional regression problems. 
    The package implements Information-Based Optimal Subdata Selection (IBOSS), Generalized IBOSS (GenIBOSS), 
    Combining Lasso and Subdata Selection (CLASS), and Subsampled Randomized Hadamard Transform (SRHT). 
    CLASS identifies active variables through repeated LASSO fits on smaller data subsets and subsequently 
    uses IBOSS to select an informative subset of observations for regression. The package also implements 
    HT-CLASS, which applies a Hadamard transform before the row-sampling step to improve the identification 
    of active variables whose signals are concentrated in a small subset of observations.
